                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Hourly count of rented public bikes in Seoul from December 2017 to November 2018 (8,760 hours), with the weather at that hour: temperature, humidity, wind, visibility, solar radiation, rain and snow, plus the season, whether the day was a holiday, and whether the rental system was working.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#2D3748"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to use it",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#2D3748"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Open the Filters pane on the right (the funnel tab) to filter by category or date; the selection applies to every page. Click a bar, a slice or a point to cross-filter the other charts, and hover over one to see a small summary card.",
